<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT- UBS starts 3Dlabs as buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT- UBS starts 3Dlabs as buy.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- UBS Securities analyst Charles Boucher said he started 3Dlabs Inc with a buy rating.</p>
<p>-- He set a 1996 year earnings estimate of $0.13 per share and a 1997 year estimate of $0.76 per share.</p>
<p>-- The stock has gained 75 percent since its initial public offering of $11, he noted.</p>
</text>
